      "message": "test: tilt-head angle words are the chain's joint angles (#4417)\n\nThe pose A30 B15 and A-45 B12.25 turn both rotaries of the tilt head,\nwhose A carries its B: the posted words are now the joint angles. The\nbench 5-axis machine states its nest (B carries A), as an unstated nest\nis refused by name.\n\nRefs #4417\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
